{"c":[{"name":"20260820T233118Z-a3b7a5135628a4f0","text":"Root wake prints == Project-root Memories == when the git-root document is non-empty, catalog or not. Pull wakes stay unlabeled.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260821T155541Z-842d10e98fbc74de","text":"Emergency delete is repo-root surgery.py, not a summem subcommand: zipper break-out of containing naps, unlink that one note, heal_view; it does not rewrite git history or write nap captions.","type":"note"}]}
